  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="136a2e36-4e28-5565-9079-194420afb34f" activityNameId="1ad1f558-629e-5d21-b4ec-6ba696fd230d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Phosphoric acid plant, fertiliser grade</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Phosphoric acid plant, fertiliser grade
Large uncertainties for equipment used due to weak data from a small pilot plant. Process refers to an phosphoric acid plant using with 65'000 t phosphoric acid (as 100% H3PO4) production per year. Assumed life time 50 years.;
UUID: c9ef4080-08f4-3136-a705-124c1672a2a1
Estimation of infrastructure from wet-phosphoric acid production plant including building materials and material for processing equipment. Transport of materials to construction site. Dismaterling of plant and disposal. Land useand occupation for plant.
Location: Estimated data refers on a plant built in Jordania. Land use considered from a large plant in Florida. Land use asessed and extrapoleated with data of a mayor site in Florida.
Technology: Estimated. No specific technology modelled. Tranport requirement of steel cylinder included.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Estimation of the infrastructure will have low representativity because they were asessed with data from a small scale plant. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c9ef4080-08f4-3136-a705-124c1672a2a1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="9aaa4753-f7ef-5e0d-bcb0-bc5f01164c5b" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
